  add("paper/plugin.yml",`name: BlocksmithContent\nversion: 1.0.0\nmain: dev.blocksmith.paper.BlocksmithPlugin\napi-version: '26.2'\ndescription: Runtime target for Blocksmith collection bundles\n`);
  add(`paper/collections/${slug(packName)}_${slug(collectionName)}.json`,JSON.stringify({schema:1,pack:packName,collection:collectionName,count:projects.length,models:manifest},null,2));
  add("README.txt",`BLOCKSMITH COLLECTION BUNDLE\n\nPack: ${packName}\nCollection: ${collectionName}\nModels: ${projects.length}\n\nresource-pack/ contains one combined Minecraft 26.2 resource pack.\npaper/content/ contains every Paper content and animation definition.\nstructures/ contains Sponge v3 schematics when the collection includes structures.\n`);
  if(collectionName===DERBY_GROUP)add("BLACKWAKE_WALL_DERBY_INTEGRATION.md",`# Blackwake Wall Derby — Paper 26.2\n\nThe finished game is a shallow 17-block-wide by 7-block-high wall cabinet. View it straight-on from -Z. X runs left-to-right, Y runs bottom-to-top, and Z is only wall depth.\n\n## Rows\n\n- Y 6: marquee\n- Y 5: lane 1 / Crimson Corsair\n- Y 4: lane 2 / Golden Doubloon\n- Y 3: lane 3 / Cursed Kraken\n- Y 2: lane 4 / Pale Marauder\n- Y 1: lane 5 / Emerald Privateer\n- Y 0: controls\n\nBuild each 17-block row from eight two-block panels and one one-block end panel. Overlay a Start Marker at X 0 and Finish Marker at X 16 on every race row.\n\nEach horse is a separate shallow two-block side-profile rig. Start its root anchor near X 1. Play Side-View Run and translate only the body root along +X for 14 blocks. Do not rotate the horse toward its movement direction and do not animate Z; it must remain flat against the wall. Child displays inherit the root translation and apply their pivot-local rotations. Front is -Z, 16 pixels equal one block, and the exported animation file contains the Paper yaw and world-pivot formulas.\n`);
